WEBVTT

1
00:00:09.667 --> 00:00:16.878
Bobby couldn't stop grinning.

2
00:00:16.879 --> 00:00:18.950
It was his birthday.

3
00:00:18.951 --> 00:00:27.653
Today at one o'clock he would be nine years old.

4
00:00:27.654 --> 00:00:35.801
"Happy Birthday!" the other campers called from the blacktop.

5
00:00:35.802 --> 00:00:40.600
"Thanks," Bobby said. "Where's the party?

6
00:00:40.601 --> 00:00:43.579
Who's hiding the presents and cake?"

7
00:00:43.580 --> 00:00:48.511
Mr. Dunn laughed. "Party? Presents?

8
00:00:48.512 --> 00:00:52.335
This is camp, not a party center."

9
00:00:52.336 --> 00:00:55.893
"Oh." Bobby's grin disappeared.

10
00:00:55.894 --> 00:00:57.959
"I was just kidding."

11
00:00:57.960 --> 00:00:59.969
He looked away.

12
00:00:59.970 --> 00:01:04.916
"Sort of," he thought.

13
00:01:04.917 --> 00:01:08.688
All morning the kids played kickball on the blacktop.

14
00:01:08.689 --> 00:01:17.352
When they went back inside, Bobby was still thinking about his birthday.

15
00:01:17.353 --> 00:01:21.832
For Ethan's birthday they had made special cupcakes with Miss Shelly.

16
00:01:21.833 --> 00:01:25.851
But they weren't doing anything for Bobby's birthday!

17
00:01:25.852 --> 00:01:29.720
At twelve thirty Mr. Dunn made an announcement.

18
00:01:29.721 --> 00:01:32.774
"We're going out to the soccer field.

19
00:01:32.775 --> 00:01:37.801
Please line up."

20
00:01:37.802 --> 00:01:43.160
"That's weird," Bobby thought, following Mr. Dunn outside.

21
00:01:43.161 --> 00:01:46.858
"Mr. Dunn isn't carrying a soccer ball."

22
00:01:46.859 --> 00:01:54.026
None of the other kids seemed to notice.

23
00:01:54.027 --> 00:01:59.233
But when Bobby looked at the soccer field, he was even more confused.

24
00:01:59.234 --> 00:02:02.061
There were four tables on the field.

25
00:02:02.062 --> 00:02:05.424
A black box sat on each one.

26
00:02:05.425 --> 00:02:08.858
"Birthday boy," Mr. Dunn called.

27
00:02:08.859 --> 00:02:13.266
"Inside each box is a present from one of your friends.

28
00:02:13.267 --> 00:02:18.244
You must use your senses to figure out what each one is.

29
00:02:18.245 --> 00:02:21.433
But you'll be blindfolded."

30
00:02:21.434 --> 00:02:29.185
"If you can figure out what is inside each box," Mr. Dunn continued, "the presents are yours.

31
00:02:29.186 --> 00:02:30.865
Think you can do it?"

32
00:02:30.866 --> 00:02:34.158
Bobby grinned. He was wrong.

33
00:02:34.159 --> 00:02:38.640
His friends had planned something special for his birthday!

34
00:02:38.641 --> 00:02:44.464
"Of course I can!" he said.

35
00:02:44.465 --> 00:02:49.785
"Here's the blindfold, Mr. Dunn," said Nina.

36
00:02:49.786 --> 00:02:54.470
She passed him a handkerchief, which he used to blindfold Bobby.

37
00:02:54.471 --> 00:03:00.006
Then Mr. Dunn led Bobby up to the first box.

38
00:03:00.007 --> 00:03:06.605
"You have to use your sense of touch to guess what this present is," Mr. Dunn said.

39
00:03:06.606 --> 00:03:11.971
Bobby reached into the box and felt something hard and plastic.

40
00:03:11.972 --> 00:03:16.675
He pushed a lever and water shot out.

41
00:03:16.676 --> 00:03:20.510
"A spray soaker!" he shouted.

42
00:03:20.511 --> 00:03:23.053
"You guessed it!" Izzie said.

43
00:03:23.054 --> 00:03:26.365
The kids cheered.

44
00:03:26.366 --> 00:03:29.810
"Great job!" Mr. Dunn said.

45
00:03:29.811 --> 00:03:36.504
"Now, for box number two, you have to use your sense of smell."

46
00:03:36.505 --> 00:03:41.842
Ethan lifted the present out of the box and held it under Bobby's nose.

47
00:03:41.843 --> 00:03:45.758
Bobby sniffed. "I know this smell.

48
00:03:45.759 --> 00:03:49.345
A basketball!" he cried.

49
00:03:49.346 --> 00:03:56.869
"Right again! For box number three you can use only your sense of taste," Ethan said.

50
00:03:56.870 --> 00:04:05.006
Jason dipped a spoon into box number three and handed it to Bobby.

51
00:04:05.007 --> 00:04:08.243
"Ice cream!" cried Bobby.

52
00:04:08.244 --> 00:04:12.955
"Yum. It tastes like birthday cake!"

53
00:04:12.956 --> 00:04:15.385
Everyone cheered again.

54
00:04:15.386 --> 00:04:23.348
"For the last box, you have to use your sense of hearing," said Mr. Dunn.

55
00:04:23.349 --> 00:04:27.241
"How can I hear a present?" asked Bobby.

56
00:04:27.242 --> 00:04:30.369
Nina opened box number four.

57
00:04:30.370 --> 00:04:34.916
"I'm going to shake the present a little and then drop it on the table.

58
00:04:34.917 --> 00:04:37.398
Okay?" Nina said.

59
00:04:37.399 --> 00:04:45.240
Bobby nodded. Everyone got very quiet.

60
00:04:45.241 --> 00:04:51.063
What Bobby heard sounded like k-sh, k-sh, k-plonk.

61
00:04:51.064 --> 00:04:53.992
"I'd know that sound anywhere.

62
00:04:53.993 --> 00:04:59.761
It's a box of sour lemon balls—my favorite!" Bobby cried.

63
00:04:59.762 --> 00:05:05.053
He removed his blindfold and smiled at his friends.

64
00:05:05.054 --> 00:05:07.313
It was one o'clock.

65
00:05:07.314 --> 00:05:16.397
"Happy Birthday, Bobby!" shouted everyone.
